### VNPAY Email System - API Test Requests

### Test 1: Send email directly (sync)
GET http://localhost:8000/test-email/1
Accept: application/json

### Test 2: Preview email HTML
GET http://localhost:8000/test-email/preview/1

### Test 3: Send via Job (async)
GET http://localhost:8000/test-email/1/job
Accept: application/json

### Test 4: Send sync explicitly
GET http://localhost:8000/test-email/1/sync
Accept: application/json

### Test 5: Mock VNPAY payment callback
GET http://localhost:8000/test-vnpay-return?order_id=1
Accept: application/json

### Test 6: View logs
GET http://localhost:8000/test-logs
Accept: application/json

### Test 7: Check queue status
GET http://localhost:8000/test-queue-status
Accept: application/json

---
# Usage in REST Client (VSCode extension)

# Install: REST Client extension
# Then use Ctrl+Alt+R or Cmd+Alt+R to send requests

# Or save as .http file and use VSCode REST Client
